    "body": "Adds a config for [perl-lsp](https://github.com/tree-sitter-perl/perl-lsp), a Perl language server written in Rust on top of tree-sitter-perl.\n\nThe config follows the Neovim setup suggested in the upstream README (`cmd`, `filetypes`, `root_markers`).\n\nTested with `vim.lsp.enable('perl_lsp')` on Neovim: the client attaches to `perl` buffers and resolves the root from `cpanfile`.",
